{comment: Strumming Pattern – DD UU DUD}

{start_of_chorus: Mukhda}
[Am]Chaand ki galiyon mein, [G]tera intezaar
[F]Dil ne kaha hai yeh, [G]baar baar
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Antara 1}
[Am]Raat bhar jaage hum, [G]khwaab ke saath
[F]Teri yaadon ki, woh [G]barsaat
Tu hi meri – manzil hai
🌙 Chaand bhi kehta hai: tu aaja
{end_of_verse}

{comment: *    Antara 2 follows the same chords}

